import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 713 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 713 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post","no":713,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance","Cultivation-Path Design","Talent Matching","Everyone-a-Road"],"related":["08-Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System","37-Symbiotic Education System","50-Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0713_模块4-万族进化引导岗.md","filePath":"en/0713_模块4-万族进化引导岗.md"}`),o={name:"en/0713_模块4-万族进化引导岗.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,d,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-713-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-myriad-rank-evolution-guidance-post" tabindex="-1">Entry 713 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-713-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-myriad-rank-evolution-guidance-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 713 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 08, 37, 50</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-ones-do-the-most-patient-work" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest ones do the most patient work <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-ones-do-the-most-patient-work" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest ones do the most patient work&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the one that most tests a transcended one&#39;s patience is the Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post. A Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm strong one&#39;s daily work is not shattering stars, not crossing cosmoses, but sitting before a Sense-Origin Realm little life, listening to him describe the energy he perceives, helping him judge which cultivation system suits him. This never happens in old web novels — the stronger the protagonist, the more those around him only cry &quot;senior spare my life&quot;; no one actually asks him to sit down and lecture. Heng Yuan Zhou lists it as a core post, because <strong>the speed of Myriad-Rank uplift depends not on how strong the strongest are, but on how well latecomers are guided</strong>.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;guidance&quot;: the anti-predation axiom requires the guidance post proactively identify and cut off latecomers&#39; paths of being lured by predatory factions; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is directly this post&#39;s parent law — all beings possess equal evolution qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires the guidance post transform strong ones&#39; power into latecomers&#39; upward channel; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the guidance post not make choices for latecomers, only provide information; the law-first axiom requires all cultivation paths used by the guidance post come from the public, stable 300-set system.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-post-positioning-myriad-ranks-navigator" tabindex="-1">I. Post Positioning: Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;Navigator&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-post-positioning-myriad-ranks-navigator" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Post Positioning: Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;Navigator&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post transcended ones&#39; work is to help every being who enters cultivation find the cultivation path best suited to himself. This is not classroom teaching, but <strong>personalized navigation</strong>:</p><ul><li>Assess the visitor&#39;s life form (humankind, alien beast, plant spirit, planet consciousness, Cosmos-Origin Entity, etc.);</li><li>Assess his talent inclination (energy-perception type, law-understanding type, spatial-dispatch type, consciousness-resonance type, etc.);</li><li>Assess his environmental conditions (energy density of his plane, available resources, time flow);</li><li>Recommend the best-matched combination path from the 300-set Origin Cultivation System;</li><li>Design short-, mid-, and long-term cultivation goals, tracking and adjusting.</li></ul><p>This seems simple, but actually requires the transcended one to have deep understanding of every branch of the five Myriad-Rank lineages (carbon-based matter, energy-condensation, mechanical-construction, consciousness-information, mixed-variant). A transcended one who can only teach human cultivators is unqualified for this post.</p><h2 id="ii-three-core-tasks-of-the-guidance-post" tabindex="-1">II. Three Core Tasks of the Guidance Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-core-tasks-of-the-guidance-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Core Tasks of the Guidance Post&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-path-recommendation" tabindex="-1">2.1 Path Recommendation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-path-recommendation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Path Recommendation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>This is the highest-frequency daily work. A visitor comes with confusion: which set should I cultivate? Should I take Deduction-Iteration or Life-Cycle? Where is my current bottleneck?</p><p>The guidance-post transcended one does not directly give answers, but through the anchor network pulls the visitor&#39;s historical cultivation data, talent assessment report, and current bottleneck analysis, then gives <strong>three candidate paths</strong> with their respective risks and returns. The right of choice is the visitor&#39;s — this is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s landing at the guidance post: we only backflow knowledge, we do not decide for you.</p><h3 id="_2-2-deviation-correction" tabindex="-1">2.2 Deviation Correction <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-deviation-correction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Deviation Correction&quot;">​</a></h3><p>When a cultivator goes off track — for example, starts being lured by predatory factions, starts indulging shortcut inner demons, starts showing isolated self-cultivation tendency — the guidance-post transcended one proactively intervenes:</p><ul><li>Identify deviation signs through Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision;</li><li>Talk as a mentor, no criticism, no humiliation, only facts;</li><li>Help him analyze the cost of deviation, provide feasible paths to return to the right way;</li><li>Throughout, no forced intervention; only speak when he is willing to listen.</li></ul><h3 id="_2-3-special-life-adaptation" tabindex="-1">2.3 Special-Life Adaptation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-special-life-adaptation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Special-Life Adaptation&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Per Documents 53 and 54, strange beings have their own identification and handling procedures. Guidance-post transcended ones design exclusive cultivation paths for special life forms:</p><ul><li>Plant spirits: based on the Life-Cycle system, modify energy-absorption channels;</li><li>Planet consciousness: based on the Spatial-Law Dispatch system, modify consciousness diffusion;</li><li>Cosmos-Origin Entities: based on the Deduction-Iteration system, modify their interface with origin;</li><li>Multiverse residual civilizations: based on cross-plane anchor construction, help them integrate into the anchor network.</li></ul><p>This category of work best embodies the depth of the republican axiom of Myriad Races — not transforming all life by the humankind template, but <strong>finding each kind of life its own uplift road</strong>.</p><h2 id="iii-the-guidance-post-s-link-with-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">III. The Guidance Post&#39;s Link with the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-guidance-post-s-link-with-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Guidance Post&#39;s Link with the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 23&#39;s 20% Activation Strategy — where does its backbone come from? From the guidance post.</p><p>The strategy goal is to activate 20% of beings into plane-transcendent strong ones. This cannot rely on natural growth — someone must proactively identify suitable latecomers, guide them up, and lift them for a stretch. The guidance-post transcended ones are the core executors of this &quot;identify–guide–lift&quot;:</p><ul><li>Each year identify seed candidates from Myriad Ranks with potential to attack the Origin Realm;</li><li>Design exclusive cultivation paths for seed candidates, match them with Multiplication-Fruit Technology and joint-contracting resources;</li><li>Provide mental and law-level escort at key breakthrough nodes;</li><li>The plane-transcendent strong ones cultivated then guide the next generation of seeds.</li></ul><p>This is a <strong>self-replicating guidance network</strong>. The guidance-post transcended one is not guiding Myriad Ranks alone; he is training thousands of secondary guides — this is the concrete mechanism of &quot;carrying Myriad Ranks uplift.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-the-guidance-post-and-the-selfless-dao" tabindex="-1">IV. The Guidance Post and the Selfless Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-guidance-post-and-the-selfless-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Guidance Post and the Selfless Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><p>All work products of guidance-post transcended ones flow back to the Selfless-Dao public library:</p><ul><li>Personalized path-recommendation case library (desensitized);</li><li>Deviation-correction methodology;</li><li>Special-life adaptation design schemes;</li><li>20% Activation Strategy stage summaries.</li></ul><p>After this knowledge flows back, other guidance-post transcended ones and other cultivators may learn and use it. The guidance post thus becomes <strong>Myriad Ranks&#39; largest cultivation-knowledge production workshop</strong> — it produces not manuals, but the methodology of &quot;how to help people find manuals.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the guidance post avoids talent mismatch, letting every cultivator&#39;s talent land on the best-suited path</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the guidance post proactively cuts off latecomers&#39; paths of being lured by predatory factions, reducing new increments of predatory-style cultivation at the source</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style guidance is &quot;the protagonist passes it on to whoever he fancies&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou-style guidance is &quot;the anchor network guides whoever it assesses&quot; — not depending on any one person&#39;s eye</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the guidance post explicitly covers all life forms of the five lineages; special lives have exclusive paths</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: guidance methodology, case library, special-life adaptation schemes are all public in the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The strongest ones do the most patient work. This is not putting a big talent to small use; this is putting a big talent to big use — <strong>one transcended one cultivating a hundred plane-transcendent strong ones in a lifetime contributes a hundred million times more to Myriad Ranks than he himself shattering a hundred planets.</strong> Guidance-post transcended ones do not pursue personal fame; what they pursue is: when this generation of transcended ones retires and rotates, there are already enough new transcended ones among Myriad Ranks to take over.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">Entry 50 · Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20％激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20% Activation Strategy Plan</a></li></ul>',36)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
